  "worked_solution": "The existential quantifier \"$\u2203$\" means \"there exists.\" So, the statement \n$\u2203n\\in Z,\\,D(n)$ \nreads as follows:\n\n$\\,$ **There exists** $n\\in Z$ **such that** ${n}^{2}$ is divisible by $5.$\n\n**Note:** This statement is true.",
